  "headline": "Liverpool’s academy plans its next generation under Iraola",
  "summary": "BBC Sport reports that Liverpool are strengthening the route from their academy to the first team under Andoni Iraola. Young players including Rio Ngumoha and Trey Nyoni have already featured this season. Academy director Alex Inglethorpe says the aim is to develop players who can help Liverpool win trophies. A £20m upgrade to the academy is planned for completion by 2028, while the club is reviewing its youth wage structure as competition for teenage talent grows.",
